				"**镜头 1 (0-4s)**  \nExtreme close-up: handsome anime male with messy black hair, round red glasses, red turtleneck, holding paper \"XYZ\". Slow push-in. Neon Shinjuku lights reflect on lenses. 1980s retro anime, cinematic, moody.\n\n**镜头 2 (4-10s)**  \nMedium shot: glamorous woman, long dark wavy hair, midnight blue gown & gloves, handing a white card in dim detective agency. Panoramic window shows neon Shinjuku. Smooth pan, cyberpunk glow, City Hunter aesthetic.\n\n**镜头 3 (10-12s)**  \nHigh-speed action: office door bursts open; furious short-haired woman in leather jacket & jeans swings massive black hammer labeled \"100T\". Heavy motion blur, speed lines. Cut to male's exaggerated terrified face, bulging eyes, sweat drops. Slapstick comedy.\n\n**镜头 4 (12-15s)**  \nHigh angle: 100T hammer slams floor, cracking tiles. Male flattened under it, only red sweater & glasses visible. Woman stands victoriously, hands on hips, sighing. Dust settles. Humorous ending, static camera, 80s cel-shaded style.",
